{"id":"1e5b78bfb3887990","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-horn-formula.md","title":"Horn Formula","display":"df-horn-formula — Horn Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_section":"6.2","source_result":"Unnumbered definition of basic Horn/Horn formulas","source_pages_print":"407","source_pages_djvu":"423","source_verification":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-horn-formula","aliases":["17-df-horn-formula"],"display":"df-horn-formula — Horn Formula","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-atomic-formula]]","[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-symbols]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-6.3.1"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Unnumbered definition of basic Horn/Horn formulas"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"407"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"423"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-horn-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-horn-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-horn-formula — Horn Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b456e6677109f36b\" href=\"?note=b456e6677109f36b\" title=\"17-df-atomic-formula\">17-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-6.3.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b456e6677109f36b\" href=\"?note=b456e6677109f36b\" title=\"17-df-atomic-formula\">17-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>。有限序列函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Or}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Or}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{And}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{And}_L\\)</span> 及对象语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\exists\\)</span> 均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a> 的展开定义，不视为未声明的原始语法。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(m,k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^m\">\\(\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\operatorname{HornClause}_L^k\">\\(C\\in\\operatorname{HornClause}_L^k\\)</span> 是各自集合定义中受量词约束的局部参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(i),C(j)\">\\(\\ell(i),C(j)\\)</span> 是有限序列的函数值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HornClause}_L,\\operatorname{HornForm}_L,\\operatorname{QFHorn}_L,\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{HornClause}_L,\\operatorname{HornForm}_L,\\operatorname{QFHorn}_L,\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\)</span> 是下式定义的公式集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{HornClause}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^m\\;\\Bigl[\n\\varphi=\\operatorname{Or}_L(\\ell)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\bigl(\\ell(i)\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\n\\lor\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\;\\ell(i)=\\neg A\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i,j&lt;m\\;\n\\bigl((\\ell(i)\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\land\\ell(j)\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L)\\to i=j\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{QFHorn}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{HornClause}_L^k\\;\n\\varphi=\\operatorname{And}_L(C)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HornForm}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\operatorname{HornClause}_L\\subseteq H\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in H\\;(\\varphi\\land\\psi\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in H\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\;\n(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in H\\land\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\in H)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HornSent}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{HornForm}_L\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_L.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{HornClause}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^m\\;\\Bigl[\n\\varphi=\\operatorname{Or}_L(\\ell)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\bigl(\\ell(i)\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\n\\lor\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\;\\ell(i)=\\neg A\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i,j&lt;m\\;\n\\bigl((\\ell(i)\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\land\\ell(j)\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L)\\to i=j\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{QFHorn}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{HornClause}_L^k\\;\n\\varphi=\\operatorname{And}_L(C)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HornForm}_L\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\operatorname{HornClause}_L\\subseteq H\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in H\\;(\\varphi\\land\\psi\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in H\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\;\n(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in H\\land\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\in H)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HornSent}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{HornForm}_L\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_L.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p407 的 Horn 构造同时允许合取、存在量词和全称量词。此前仅取全称闭包，会使约化积刻画错误地排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x P(x)\">\\(\\exists x P(x)\\)</span>。这里保留完整 Horn 类；全称 Horn 是其子类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","lev